WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:25.576
[Warm 80s Sophisti-Pop Intro]

00:00:25.576 --> 00:00:28.137
There was a boy I used to be

00:00:31.479 --> 00:00:34.581
Who saw the world so simply

00:00:36.883 --> 00:00:39.844
Thought every road was straight and true

00:00:39.904 --> 00:00:42.666
Beneath a sky of perfect blue

00:00:48.803 --> 00:00:54.810
He thought that love was just a phrase

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:58.654
For sunny, easy, golden days

00:01:00.656 --> 00:01:05.000
He called you all his guiding stars

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.500
Before he knew about the scars

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.500
But I learned the sky can fall away

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:18.708
And turn a bright and sunny day to gray

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:23.800
And in the static and the night

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:27.500
You were my only guiding light

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:31.500
More than a feeling, more than a name

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:35.074
You were the fire, you were the flame

00:01:35.134 --> 00:01:38.000
That led me through the pouring rain

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.701
And brought me back to life again

00:01:40.701 --> 00:02:06.198
[Gentle Instrumental Interlude]

00:02:06.198 --> 00:02:09.500
I learned to wear a painted smile

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:15.502
And walk a cold and lonely mile

00:02:17.802 --> 00:02:21.500
To build a wall of industrial sound

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:24.425
On cold and unfamiliar ground

00:02:29.787 --> 00:02:32.988
I learned how silence has a weight

00:02:35.865 --> 00:02:39.427
And how a heart can fill with hate

00:02:41.608 --> 00:02:46.500
I learned that trust can be a lie

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:51.500
Beneath a cold and empty sky

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:55.834
Two stars are here, held close and tight

00:02:55.834 --> 00:02:59.615
One shines a warm and distant light

00:02:59.675 --> 00:03:02.076
A friendly face on a glowing screen

00:03:05.257 --> 00:03:08.500
The miles can't ever come between

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:11.800
The bond we made, the truth we know

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:15.500
Helping a broken boy to grow

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:19.601
And when the sky would fall away

00:03:19.701 --> 00:03:25.000
And turn a bright and sunny day to gray

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:28.500
And in the static and the night

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.945
You were my only guiding light

00:03:31.005 --> 00:03:35.500
More than a feeling, more than a name

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:39.000
You were the fire, you were the flame

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:42.000
That led me through the pouring rain

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:45.194
And brought me back to life again

00:03:45.194 --> 00:05:36.200
[Soulful Saxophone Solo Outro Fading Slowly to Silence]
